# Stub model: 1x1x1 m cube, origin at bottom-left-front corner, Y-up
mtllib model.mtl
o stub_cube
v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 1 1 0
v 0 1 0
v 0 0 1
v 1 0 1
v 1 1 1
v 0 1 1
vn 0 0 -1
vn 0 0 1
vn -1 0 0
vn 1 0 0
vn 0 -1 0
vn 0 1 0
usemtl stub
f 1//1 4//1 3//1 2//1
f 5//2 6//2 7//2 8//2
f 1//3 5//3 8//3 4//3
f 2//4 3//4 7//4 6//4
f 1//5 2//5 6//5 5//5
f 4//6 8//6 7//6 3//6
